ta-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"196cc15aecc1c1ef\" href=\"?note=196cc15aecc1c1ef\" title=\"58-df-generic-extension-step\">58-df-generic-extension-step</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the set-function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericMultiverseNode}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericMultiverseNode}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse\\text{-}node} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericMultiverseNode}_S(M,W) \\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(s,n\\cup\\{n\\},\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\land s(0)=W\\land s(n)=M\\land\\forall k\\in n\\cup\\{n\\}\\;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(s(k))\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\;(\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S(s(k),s(k+1))\\lor\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S(s(k+1),s(k)))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse\\text{-}node} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericMultiverseNode}_S(M,W) \\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(s,n\\cup\\{n\\},\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\land s(0)=W\\land s(n)=M\\land\\forall k\\in n\\cup\\{n\\}\\;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(s(k))\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\;(\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S(s(k),s(k+1))\\lor\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S(s(k+1),s(k)))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The finite zigzag is an explicitly quantified set-coded function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>; the angle-bracket sequence notation is no longer an untyped second-order witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-generic-multiverse.md","status":"resolved","id":"c83b656624a2acb7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-generic-multiverse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-extension-step.md","status":"resolved","id":"196cc15aecc1c1ef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic-extension-step.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2